# /etc/systemd/system/treant-isolation.service
# Live workspace isolation test (deploy/scripts/isolation.sh). Started by
# treant-isolation.timer. Exit 1 means a workspace could reach another's canary: treat it
# as an incident.
[Unit]
Description=Treant live workspace isolation test
Requires=docker.service
After=docker.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
Environment=COMPOSE_FILE=/opt/treant/deploy/compose.prod.yml
ExecStart=/opt/treant/deploy/scripts/isolation.sh
TimeoutStartSec=30min
Nice=10
IOSchedulingClass=idle
NoNewPrivileges=true
PrivateTmp=true
ProtectHome=true
